#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:5
#: b285c701dd8a4f5fa29abddbdcc3b780
msgid "AirMode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:7
#: 4412eca055d1430c9b06db8f17d10ebe
msgid "This is not an actual flight mode, but rather, an important feature of QACRO and QSTABILIZE modes. Other flight control software refer to it as a flight mode, so for consistency, its included in the QuadPlane flight modes documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:10
#: 6150c76371a44dd38d5d047bffd3e5a1
msgid "What it is"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:12
#: 6e67e538e60447609de4759058620c7e
msgid "Normally, in QuadPlane, if throttle is lowered to idle in QACRO or QSTABILIZE modes, the stabilization is removed. While this prevents movement due to vibration while on the ground at idle throttle, or when using rudder arming, it prevents stabilization in flight for aerobatic movements or rapid descents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:14
#: 328af623f67146ca94b60e5dc65b4b03
msgid "Instead, stabilization even at zero throttle can be enabled/disabled for these modes using an RC channel switch via ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84 (Airmode)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:16
#: 6c1aeeca528a4f428e04d84f32a741fc
msgid "if :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` is set to 2 (arm and disarm using rudder stick), while in Airmode, you cannot disarm using rudder. This allows full rudder stick throws without the chance of a disarm occurring."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:18
#: 972a7004a339497eb45f41223a93e294
msgid "If Airmode is enabled by this switch while disarmed, and you arm via rudder, the aircraft will immediately attempt to yaw to the right while still on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:20
#: 62723cff7ce04c87ad1c26d1de2ac5a9
msgid "If you arm using an RC switch (``RCx_OPTION`` = 154), AirMode will be active but can be disabled with the above switch. If you arm using an RC switch using the (``RCx_OPTION`` = 153) function, then AirMode can only be enabled or disabled using the ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84 switch function."
msgstr ""
